{"id":"n-20261009-w7vm44","category":"tech","display_title":"Cyberpunk 2077 Live Action Movie","display_title_he":"סרט לייב-אקשן לסייברפאנק 2077","short_summary":"CD Projekt Red's Cyberpunk 2077 is being adapted into a live-action film at Paramount Pictures, produced alongside longtime Transformers producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura.","english_level":"C1","words":416,"reading_time":3,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Ghost_In_The_Shell_World_Premiere_Red_Carpet-_Yamamoto_Kaori%2C_Rila_Fukushima%2C_Pilou_Asb%C3%A6k%2C_Kitano_Takeshi%2C_Scarlett_Johansson%2C_Juliette_Binoche%2C_Rupert_Sanders%2C_Momoi_Kaori_%26_Izumihara_Yutaka_%2837357717766%29.jpg/960px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Dick Thomas Johnson from Tokyo, Japan · CC BY 2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ghost_In_The_Shell_World_Premiere_Red_Carpet-_Yamamoto_Kaori,_Rila_Fukushima,_Pilou_Asb%C3%A6k,_Kitano_Takeshi,_Scarlett_Johansson,_Juliette_Binoche,_Rupert_Sanders,_Momoi_Kaori_%26_Izumihara_Yutaka_(37357717766).jpg"},"sources":[{"name":"Polygon","domain":"polygon.com","url":"https://www.polygon.com/cyberpunk-2077-movie-paramount-pictures","title":"Cyberpunk 2077 Live-Action Movie Officially Announced","published_at":"2026-10-08T18:59:26.000Z"},{"name":"IGN","domain":"ign.com","url":"https://www.ign.com/articles/a-live-action-cyberpunk-2077-movie-is-in-the-works-at-paramount","title":"A Live-Action Cyberpunk 2077 Movie Is in the Works at Paramount","published_at":"2026-10-08T18:11:35.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:11:35.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-09T06:31:46.178Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":9,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["According to recent reports, CD Projekt Red's popular sci-fi role-playing game Cyberpunk 2077 is officially making its way to the silver screen. Paramount Pictures is currently developing a live-action film adaptation of the franchise, marking another major video game project for the studio alongside upcoming adaptations for Street Fighter and Call of Duty.","The project will be produced in collaboration with CD Projekt Red and veteran producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, who is well known for his extensive work on the Transformers film series alongside Steven Spielberg and Michael Bay, as well as the G.I. Joe films. Michał Nowakowski, the joint-CEO of CD Projekt, stated that the company is thrilled about Paramount acting as a future partner that shares their creative ambitions for the Cyberpunk franchise. He added that they look forward to sharing further details when the appropriate time arrives. At present, specific details regarding who will write, direct, or star in the cinematic adaptation have not been announced.","The futuristic setting of Cyberpunk 2077 focuses on a mercenary named V who accepts a dangerous contract to steal a one-of-a-kind implant. This cybernetic biochip contains the personality and memories of a legendary rock star and terrorist named Johnny Silverhand, forcing the protagonist and the digital construct to cooperate to save V's life. The story unfolds within the stylized, dystopian Night City, which is governed by the powerful Arasaka Corporation.","Initially released in December 2020 after more than eight years since its original announcement, the video game debuted in an infamously dire state. However, CD Projekt Red dedicated subsequent years to significantly improving the software, transforming it into a massive fan favorite that eventually surpassed forty million copies sold, according to Nowakowski. The developer also released an expansion titled Cyberpunk 2077: Phantom Liberty in 2025, which featured Idris Elba in the cast. Furthermore, CD Projekt previously collaborated with Japanese animation studio Trigger on the Netflix anime series Cyberpunk: Edgerunners, which began streaming in 2022, with a stand-alone sequel series, Cyberpunk: Edgerunners 2, slated to premiere on Netflix on October 20.","Paramount is actively expanding its portfolio of major video game adaptations. Additionally, the studio recently merged with Warner Brothers, granting it a wealth of new intellectual property to utilize. Meanwhile, CD Projekt Red is also progressing with future gaming projects, including a video game sequel to Cyberpunk 2077 announced under the working title Project Orion. In May 2025, CD Projekt announced that the sequel, now known as Cyberpunk 2, had entered pre-production and is expected to release after The Witcher 4, potentially around 2029 or 2030 at the absolute earliest."],"facts":[{"fact":"Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action Cyberpunk 2077 movie.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"Lorenzo di Bonaventura and CD Projekt Red are attached to produce the film.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"CD Projekt joint-CEO Michał Nowakowski expressed excitement about partnering with Paramount.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"No writers, directors, or cast members have been announced yet.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"Cyberpunk 2077 features a mercenary named V and the digital ghost of Johnny Silverhand, navigating dystopian Night City controlled by the Arasaka Corporation.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The original game launched in 2020, was later improved significantly, and has sold over 40 million copies.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"CD Projekt previously collaborated with studio Trigger on the Netflix animated series Cyberpunk: Edgerunners, with a sequel series set for October 20.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"A video game sequel, known as Cyberpunk 2 or Project Orion, entered pre-production in May 2025.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"according to","lemma":"according to","pos":"prep","he":"לפי","name":false},{"text":"recent","lemma":"recent","pos":"adj","he":"אחרון","name":false},{"text":"reports","lemma":"report","pos":"noun","he":"דיווחים","name":false},{"text":"popular","lemma":"popular","pos":"adj","he":"